<title>USA: Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freddie Mac revised short-term discount note rates Thursday as follows:</p>
<p> -		 MATURITY--RATE</p>
<p> -		Overnight--5.06</p>
<p> -		Dec 19,20--5.16</p>
<p> -		Dec 30,31--5.16</p>
<p>-  Jan 6,13,14,15,16,17--5.30</p>
<p>-  March 3,10,12,13,14--5.20</p>
</text>
